                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.842/140: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis
                                Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-07-22T12:00:00+03:00">July 22,
                        1936—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received July 23—6:02 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>485. I have just learned informally that the Legation radio stations will not be
                    permitted to resume transmitting until further notice.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
